  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your psicrystal’s presence grants you focus.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Psicrystal Containment.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> So long as your psicrystal is within 5 feet of you, you are always treated as if you are maintaining psionic focus for abilities powered by maintaining psionic focus. You may still only expend your psionic focus if you are actually maintaining psionic focus. In addition, you can expend a use of mythic power as a swift action to regain both your own and your psicrystal’s psionic focus.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-enhancement-feats#toc45\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
